\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z) & =\\pi -|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{y}{x})| \\\\  & =\\pi -|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(-3)| \\\\  & ≈1.893.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $r=2\\sqrt{10}$ and $\\theta =1.893$ into $z=r{e}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ we get\n\n$$\nz=2\\sqrt{10}\\,{\\text{e}}^{1.893\\,\\text{i}}.\n$$" 13194139535220 true] [17592186338273 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338274 13194139535220 true] [17592186338273 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338275 13194139535220 true] [17592186338273 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338276 13194139535220 true] [17592186338273 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338277 13194139535220 true] [17592186338273 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338278 13194139535220 true] [17592186338273 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535220 true] [17592186338273 1041 "selection" 13194139535220 true] [17592186338273 1104 #edb/ref 17592186338276 13194139535220 true] [17592186338273 1110 #uuid "e5df713a-1952-5f2f-aad9-fbc435f9cd6a" 13194139535220 true] [17592186338274 1034 "z=2\\sqrt{10}\\,{\\text{e}}^{1.389\\,\\text{i}}" 13194139535220 true] [17592186338274 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535220 true] [17592186338274 1111 #uuid "9284b0a5-6797-5f77-b7a1-d4c0b8fe315e" 13194139535220 true] [17592186338275 1034 "z=2\\sqrt{10}\\,{\\text{e}}^{\\pi \\text{i}/3}" 13194139535220 true] [17592186338275 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535220 true] [17592186338275 1111 #uuid "027c16c5-2973-5717-8af4-0135a10f6020" 13194139535220 true] [17592186338276 1034 "z=2\\sqrt{10}\\,{\\text{e}}^{1.893\\,\\text{i}}" 13194139535220 true] [17592186338276 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535220 true] [17592186338276 1111 #uuid "76927f0f-078b-5d44-88fa-aa29a676241c" 13194139535220 true] [17592186338277 1034 "z=\\sqrt{3}\\,{\\text{e}}^{\\pi \\text{i}/3}" 13194139535220 true] [17592186338277 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535220 true] [17592186338277 1111 #uuid "274fc05d-1f82-55d1-bec8-b925b6291c70" 13194139535220 true] [17592186338278 1034 "z=2\\sqrt{10}\\,{\\text{e}}^{1.983\\,\\text{i}}" 13194139535220 true] [17592186338278 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535220 true] [17592186338278 1111 #uuid "42cfe6cd-8c70-5046-b98e-d974d4d8aea6" 13194139535220 true] [17592186338279 1017 #edb/ref 17592186338280 13194139535220 true] [17592186338279 1089 "q-8079" 13194139535220 true] [17592186338279 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045463 13194139535220 true] [17592186338279 1100 "Write the complex number $z=1-\\text{i}\\sqrt{3}$ in exponential form." 13194139535220 true] [17592186338279 1113 #uuid "389cf7b9-2b41-57c8-80f6-0da73021dc80" 13194139535220 true] [17592186338279 1145 "To write our complex number in the form $z=r{\\text{e}}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ where $r=|z|$ and $\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z),$ we first calculate $r:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}r=|z| & =\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+{y}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+(-\\sqrt{3})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4}=2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, since $z$ lies in the fourth quadrant, we can find the angle $\\theta $ as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\theta =\\operatorname{arg}⁡(z) & =2\\pi -|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{y}{x})| \\\\  & =2\\pi -|\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(-\\sqrt{3})| \\\\  & =2\\pi -\\frac{\\pi }{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{5\\pi }{3}\\,.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, substituting $r=2$ and $\\theta =\\frac{5\\pi }{3}$ into $z=r{e}^{\\text{i}\\theta },$ we get\n\n$$\nz=2\\,{\\text{e}}^{5\\pi \\text{i}/3}.\n$$" 13194139535220 true] [17592186338280 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338281 13194139535220 true] [17592186338280 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338282 13194139535220 true] [17592186338280 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338283 13194139535220 true] [17592186338280 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338284 13194139535220 true] [17592186338280 1000 #edb/ref 17592186338285 13194139535220 true] [17592186338280 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535220 true] [17592186338280 1041 "selection" 13194139535220 true] [17592186338280 1104 #edb/ref 17592186338285 13194139535220 true] [17592186338280 1110 #uuid "a9651cee-cfac-5a7f-beb7-821a6a9f1e80" 13194139535220 true] [17592186338281 1034 "z=2\\,{\\t